1
00:00:00.029 --> 00:00:01.700
Welcome to Resgrid Academy.

2
00:00:02.130 --> 00:00:06.289
In this lesson, we will know what is
available, issued, and expiring.

3
00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:11.420
Unrecorded transfers and missing expiry
dates make stock levels unreliable

4
00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:13.260
and replenishment harder to plan.

5
00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:16.809
We will explain the features, the setup
decisions, and a

6
00:00:16.809 --> 00:00:18.690
practical way to check the result.

7
00:00:19.439 --> 00:00:22.969
Medical supplies are tracked by lot with
expiry alerts, and

8
00:00:22.969 --> 00:00:24.940
turnout gear is issued to members.

9
00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:29.000
Know what you have, where it is and what
is about to expire.

10
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:33.019
The examples in this series use a
fictional department and are teaching

11
00:00:33.019 --> 00:00:35.340
scenarios, not default settings.

12
