43
00:02:07.949 --> 00:02:08.670
Step 1.

44
00:02:09.000 --> 00:02:12.379
Define the stock locations and items the
department will track.

45
00:02:12.749 --> 00:02:13.499
Step 2.

46
00:02:13.919 --> 00:02:18.110
Record a receipt, transfer, and equipment
