54
00:02:40.890 --> 00:02:44.109
Reconcile the receipt before assuming
stock is available.

55
00:02:44.719 --> 00:02:46.280
Your practice task is simple.

56
00:02:46.759 --> 00:02:51.600
Receive ten demo supplies, transfer two,
and issue one durable item.

57
00:02:52.029 --> 00:02:55.590
Reconcile the resulting balances and
inspect expiry alerts.

58
00:02:55.979 --> 00:02:59.840
Record the result, who owns the follow-up,
and when it should be reviewed.

